{{ArcaneBox}}'''Arcane Camisado''' is an [[Arcane Enhancement]] for Warframes that increases the {{Stat|Ability Strength}} of the next ability cast based on attacks from [[Summons|summoned minions]]. When fully ranked, the Arcane also gives minions 20% more movement speed.

