{{Acquisition|*Can be bought from [[Eleanor]] of {{Faction|The Hex}} for {{sc|7,500}} at '''Rank 3: 2-For-1'''.
*Rewarded from the [[1999 Calendar]].
*Rewarded from Techrot Safes in [[Höllvania]] [[Hell-Scrub]] and [[Legacyte Harvest]] missions.
*Rewarded from Scaldra Caches in Höllvania [[Exterminate]] missions.
*Dropped by the {{E|H-09 Efervon Tank}} in Höllvania [[Assassination]] missions.
*Rewarded from Höllvania [[Faceoff]] missions.
*Dropped by the {{E|Scaldra Screamer}} in Höllvania [[Stage Defense]] missions.}}

==Notes==
*The following are counted as summons:
**{{WF|Atlas}}' {{A|Rumblers}}
**{{WF|Caliban}}'s {{A|Lethal Progeny}}
***This includes [[Choralyst]]s summoned by the [[Summulyst]]
***[[Conculyst]]s damaging enemies with {{A|Fusion Strike}} will also provide stacks
**{{WF|Chroma}}'s {{A|Effigy}}
**{{WF|Dante}}'s Paragrimms from {{A|Final Verse|Pageflight}}
**{{WF|Equinox}}'s {{M|Duality}}
