**{{WF|Khora}}'s {{Companion|Venari}}
**{{WF|Loki}}'s {{A|Decoy}}
***Damage dealt by {{M|Damage Decoy}} does '''not''' increase Arcane Camisado's stacks
***The Decoy seems to only give stacks against enemies at melee range
